WEBVTT

00:12:28.480 --> 00:12:32.223
On a dark, moonless night,

00:12:32.223 --> 00:12:36.471
they began scaling that rock wall,

00:12:36.471 --> 00:12:40.090
a drop of more than 1,000 feet,

00:12:40.090 --> 00:12:42.737
in full combat gear.

00:12:42.737 --> 00:12:45.581
They climbed all night long

00:12:45.581 --> 00:12:48.631
on that sheer cliff.

00:12:50.279 --> 00:12:52.232
In the darkness,

00:12:52.232 --> 00:12:54.312
some lost their handhold

00:12:54.312 --> 00:12:55.925
or their footing

00:12:55.925 --> 00:12:58.122
and they fell to their deaths

00:12:58.122 --> 00:13:00.203
in the ravine below.